msgid "A key is saved but can no longer be decrypted, probably because AUTH_KEY in wp-config.php changed. Enter the key again."
msgstr "Key tersimpan tetapi tidak bisa didekripsi lagi, kemungkinan karena AUTH_KEY di wp-config.php berubah. Masukkan key lagi."

#: includes/class-admin.php:617
msgid "No key yet. Create one in the Anthropic Console under API keys, then paste it here."
msgstr "Belum ada key. Buat key di Anthropic Console pada menu API keys, lalu tempel di sini."

#: includes/class-admin.php:624
msgid "Remove the stored key"
msgstr "Hapus key yang tersimpan"

#: includes/class-admin.php:626
msgid "Stored encrypted with a key derived from AUTH_KEY in wp-config.php. For more safety, put it in wp-config.php instead: define( 'CONTEXTCHAT_ANTHROPIC_KEY', 'sk-ant-…' );"
msgstr "Disimpan terenkripsi dengan kunci turunan dari AUTH_KEY di wp-config.php. Agar lebih aman, taruh di wp-config.php: define( 'CONTEXTCHAT_ANTHROPIC_KEY', 'sk-ant-…' );"

#: includes/class-admin.php:632
msgid "SI chat in the panel"
msgstr "Chat SI di panel"

#: includes/class-admin.php:633
msgid "When this is on and a key is saved, visitors chat with the SI in the panel: it answers from the Knowledge tab, collects the details your team needs, gives estimates from the price table, and hands the chat to your team on WhatsApp or by email with a summary. When it is off, the panel works as before. Chat text is sent to Anthropic for processing; mention this in your privacy policy."
msgstr "Bila ini menyala dan kunci tersimpan, pengunjung mengobrol dengan SI di panel: SI menjawab dari tab Pengetahuan, mengumpulkan detail yang dibutuhkan tim Anda, memberi estimasi dari tabel harga, dan meneruskan chat ke tim Anda lewat WhatsApp atau email beserta ringkasannya. Bila mati, panel bekerja seperti sebelumnya. Teks chat dikirim ke Anthropic untuk diproses; cantumkan hal ini di kebijakan privasi Anda."

#: includes/class-admin.php:636
msgid "Turn on the SI chat"
msgstr "Nyalakan chat SI"

#: includes/class-admin.php:636
msgid "Off after updating, so an update never changes your site by surprise."
msgstr "Mati setelah pembaruan, agar pembaruan tidak pernah mengubah situs Anda tanpa diduga."

#: includes/class-admin.php:637
msgid "Business name"
msgstr "Nama usaha"

#: includes/class-admin.php:637
msgid "How the SI names your business, e.g. Nusalexia. Empty: the site title."
msgstr "Nama usaha yang dipakai SI, misalnya Nusalexia. Kosong: judul situs."

#: includes/class-admin.php:638
msgid "Email for handoffs"
msgstr "Email untuk penerusan"

#: includes/class-admin.php:638
msgid "Where the \"Email\" button writes to, e.g. info@nusalexia.co.id. Empty: the site's admin email."
msgstr "Alamat tujuan tombol \"Email\", misalnya info@nusalexia.co.id. Kosong: email admin situs."

#: includes/class-admin.php:639
msgid "First available agent"
msgstr "Agen pertama yang tersedia"

#: includes/class-admin.php:643
msgid "Agent for translation"
msgstr "Agen untuk terjemahan"

#: includes/class-admin.php:644
msgid "Agent for interpreting"
msgstr "Agen untuk interpretasi"

#: includes/class-admin.php:645
msgid "Offer the team after silence (minutes)"
msgstr "Tawarkan tim setelah diam (menit)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:649
msgid "Model routing"
msgstr "Pemilihan model"

#: includes/class-admin.php:650
msgid "In automatic mode the fast model writes every reply. When a reply fails ContextChat's checks, is declined or is cut off, the stronger model writes it again. Most chats only ever use the fast model."
msgstr "Dalam mode otomatis, model cepat menulis setiap balasan. Jika balasan gagal dalam pemeriksaan ContextChat, ditolak, atau terpotong, model yang lebih kuat menulis ulang balasan itu. Sebagian besar chat hanya memakai model cepat."

#: includes/class-admin.php:655
msgid "Routing"
msgstr "Pemilihan"

#: includes/class-admin.php:657
msgid "Automatic: fast model first, stronger model when a reply fails a check (recommended)"
msgstr "Otomatis: model cepat dulu, model lebih kuat jika balasan gagal dalam pemeriksaan (disarankan)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:658
msgid "Fast model only (lowest cost, no retry)"
msgstr "Hanya model cepat (biaya terendah, tanpa percobaan ulang)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:659
msgid "Stronger model for every reply (highest cost)"
msgstr "Model lebih kuat untuk setiap balasan (biaya tertinggi)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:662
msgid "Fast model"
msgstr "Model cepat"

#: includes/class-admin.php:662
msgid "Writes every reply in automatic mode. Default: claude-haiku-5-5."
msgstr "Menulis setiap balasan dalam mode otomatis. Bawaan: claude-haiku-5-5."

#: includes/class-admin.php:663
msgid "Stronger model"
msgstr "Model lebih kuat"

#: includes/class-admin.php:663
msgid "Writes a reply again when the fast model's reply cannot be used. Default: claude-sonnet-5-5."
msgstr "Menulis ulang balasan jika balasan model cepat tidak bisa dipakai. Bawaan: claude-sonnet-5-5."

#: includes/class-admin.php:666
msgid "Thinking effort"
msgstr "Tingkat penalaran"

#: includes/class-admin.php:668
msgid "Low (fastest replies; enough for chat)"
msgstr "Rendah (balasan tercepat; cukup untuk chat)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:669
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "Sedang"

#: includes/class-admin.php:670
msgid "High (slower, more thorough)"
msgstr "Tinggi (lebih lambat, lebih teliti)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:673
msgid "Longest reply (tokens)"
msgstr "Balasan terpanjang (token)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:676
msgid "Daily spending cap (USD)"
msgstr "Batas biaya harian (USD)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:688
msgid "When the cap is reached, no more requests are sent until the next day (site time zone). Costs are estimated from Anthropic's published prices."
msgstr "Jika batas tercapai, tidak ada permintaan yang dikirim sampai hari berikutnya (zona waktu situs). Biaya diperkirakan dari harga resmi Anthropic."

#: includes/class-admin.php:694 includes/class-admin.php:700
msgid "Test connection"
msgstr "Uji koneksi"

#: includes/class-admin.php:695
msgid "Sends one message to Anthropic with the saved key and settings, and shows which model answered. Save your changes first. A test costs a fraction of a cent and counts toward the daily cap."
msgstr "Mengirim satu pesan ke Anthropic dengan key dan pengaturan yang tersimpan, lalu menampilkan model yang menjawab. Simpan perubahan terlebih dahulu. Satu uji berbiaya kurang dari satu sen dan dihitung dalam batas harian."

#: includes/class-admin.php:697
msgid "Test message"
msgstr "Pesan uji"

#: includes/class-admin.php:698
msgid "Hello! What is a sworn translation?"
msgstr "Halo! Apa itu terjemahan tersumpah?"

#: includes/class-admin.php:699
msgid "Treat the first reply as failing a check, to see the stronger model take over"
msgstr "Anggap balasan pertama gagal dalam pemeriksaan, untuk melihat model lebih kuat mengambil alih"

#: includes/class-admin.php:714
msgid "answered"
msgstr "menjawab"

#: includes/class-admin.php:715
msgid "reply failed a check"
msgstr "balasan gagal dalam pemeriksaan"

#: includes/class-admin.php:716
msgid "declined to answer"
msgstr "menolak menjawab"

#: includes/class-admin.php:717
msgid "reply cut off"
msgstr "balasan terpotong"

#: includes/class-admin.php:718
msgid "empty reply"
msgstr "balasan kosong"

#: includes/class-admin.php:719
msgid "model not found"
msgstr "model tidak ditemukan"

#: includes/class-admin.php:720
msgid "Anthropic busy or unreachable, tried twice"
msgstr "Anthropic sibuk atau tidak terjangkau, sudah dicoba dua kali"

#: includes/class-admin.php:721
msgid "API key refused"
msgstr "API key ditolak"

#: includes/class-admin.php:722
msgid "Anthropic account spend limit reached"
msgstr "batas belanja akun Anthropic tercapai"

#: includes/class-admin.php:723
msgid "request refused as invalid"
msgstr "permintaan ditolak karena tidak valid"

#: includes/class-admin.php:724
msgid "daily spending cap reached"
msgstr "batas biaya harian tercapai"

#: includes/class-admin.php:725
msgid "no API key saved"
msgstr "belum ada API key tersimpan"

#: includes/class-admin.php:726
msgid "unexpected error"
msgstr "galat tak terduga"

#: includes/class-admin.php:829
msgid "The SI states facts about your services, process and policies only from these entries. Prices are not entered here: they come from the price table, and every total is calculated in code. Leave out anything private, such as tax numbers, bank accounts, staff names and client names."
msgstr "SI hanya menyampaikan fakta tentang layanan, proses, dan kebijakan Anda dari entri-entri ini. Harga tidak diisi di sini: harga berasal dari tabel harga, dan setiap total dihitung oleh kode. Jangan cantumkan hal pribadi, seperti NPWP, rekening bank, nama staf, dan nama klien."

#: includes/class-admin.php:833
msgid "Using the bundled entries, taken from the Nusalexia guidelines and website on 21 November 2026. They follow plugin updates until you change them; after that, your own copy is kept."
msgstr "Memakai entri bawaan, diambil dari pedoman dan situs web Nusalexia pada 21 November 2026. Entri ini ikut diperbarui bersama plugin sampai Anda mengubahnya; setelah itu, salinan milik Anda yang dipakai."

#: includes/class-admin.php:835
msgid "Using your saved entries."
msgstr "Memakai entri yang Anda simpan."

#: includes/class-admin.php:845
msgid "That is more than about 30,000 tokens, which makes every reply slower and more expensive. Consider shortening entries."
msgstr "Itu lebih dari sekitar 30.000 token, sehingga setiap balasan lebih lambat dan lebih mahal. Pertimbangkan untuk memperpendek entri."

#: includes/class-admin.php:858
msgid "Add entry"
msgstr "Tambah entri"

#: includes/class-admin.php:861 includes/class-admin.php:1042
msgid "Import and export"
msgstr "Impor dan ekspor"

#: includes/class-admin.php:864 includes/class-admin.php:1045
msgid "Export"
msgstr "Ekspor"

#: includes/class-admin.php:866
msgid "The saved entries as JSON, for a backup or another site."
msgstr "Entri yang tersimpan dalam format JSON, untuk cadangan atau situs lain."

#: includes/class-admin.php:869 includes/class-admin.php:1049
msgid "Import"
msgstr "Impor"

#: includes/class-admin.php:871
msgid "Paste exported JSON here and save to replace all entries."
msgstr "Tempel JSON hasil ekspor di sini lalu simpan untuk mengganti semua entri."

#: includes/class-admin.php:874
msgid "Bundled entries"
msgstr "Entri bawaan"

#: includes/class-admin.php:875
msgid "Replace all entries with the bundled ones when saving"
msgstr "Ganti semua entri dengan entri bawaan saat menyimpan"

#: includes/class-admin.php:891
msgid "The SI chat is on but no privacy policy address is set. Indonesian law (UU 27/2022 Pasal 21, PP 33/2026 Pasal 62) expects visitors to be able to read the full privacy information before their data is processed."
msgstr "Chat SI aktif tetapi alamat kebijakan privasi belum diisi. Hukum Indonesia (UU 27/2022 Pasal 21, PP 33/2026 Pasal 62) mewajibkan pengunjung dapat membaca informasi privasi lengkap sebelum datanya diproses."

#: includes/class-admin.php:893
msgid "SI chats are stored in your WordPress database so your team can follow up. Visitors are asked not to send ID numbers or documents; messages that contain them, or links to file-sharing services, are refused and not stored. Visitor addresses are never stored: the rate limits count a hash that changes every day."
msgstr "Chat SI disimpan di database WordPress Anda agar tim bisa menindaklanjuti. Pengunjung diminta tidak mengirim nomor identitas atau dokumen; pesan yang memuatnya, atau tautan ke layanan berbagi file, ditolak dan tidak disimpan. Alamat IP pengunjung tidak pernah disimpan: batas pesan dihitung dari hash yang berganti setiap hari."

#: includes/class-admin.php:895
msgid "Keep SI chats for (days)"
msgstr "Simpan chat SI selama (hari)"

#. translators: %s: link to the Conversations screen.
#: includes/class-admin.php:902
#, php-format
msgid "Older chats, with their messages and estimates, are deleted every day. The privacy notice tells visitors this period. You can read, export or delete single chats on the %s screen."
msgstr "Chat yang lebih lama, beserta pesan dan estimasinya, dihapus setiap hari. Pemberitahuan privasi menyebutkan jangka waktu ini kepada pengunjung. Anda bisa membaca, mengekspor, atau menghapus chat satu per satu di layar %s."

#: includes/class-admin.php:908
msgid "Privacy policy address"
msgstr "Alamat kebijakan privasi"

#: includes/class-admin.php:908
msgid "Linked under the privacy notice at the top of the chat. Your policy should say that chat text is processed by Anthropic outside Indonesia, why, how long chats are kept, and how visitors can ask for a copy or deletion. Suggested text is in Settings → Privacy → Policy Guide."
msgstr "Ditautkan di bawah pemberitahuan privasi di bagian atas chat. Kebijakan Anda sebaiknya menyebutkan bahwa teks chat diproses oleh Anthropic di luar Indonesia, untuk apa, berapa lama chat disimpan, dan cara pengunjung meminta salinan atau penghapusan. Contoh teks ada di Pengaturan → Privasi → Panduan Kebijakan."

#: includes/class-admin.php:909
msgid "Ask visitors to agree first"
msgstr "Minta persetujuan pengunjung lebih dulu"

#: includes/class-admin.php:909
msgid "Shows the privacy notice with an \"Agree and start\" button before the first message, and records which notice was agreed to and when. Use this if your privacy review chooses consent as the basis for the chat."
msgstr "Menampilkan pemberitahuan privasi dengan tombol \"Setuju dan mulai\" sebelum pesan pertama, lalu mencatat pemberitahuan mana yang disetujui dan kapan. Gunakan ini jika tinjauan privasi Anda memilih persetujuan sebagai dasar pemrosesan chat."

#: includes/class-admin.php:912
msgid "Privacy notice"
msgstr "Pemberitahuan privasi"

#: includes/class-admin.php:915
msgid "The text shown above the first message is edited on the Voice tab, under \"Privacy notice before the first message\". {retention} in it becomes the period set above."
msgstr "Teks di atas pesan pertama diubah di tab Gaya bahasa, pada \"Pemberitahuan privasi sebelum pesan pertama\". {retention} di dalamnya diganti dengan jangka waktu yang diatur di atas."

#: includes/class-admin.php:921
msgid "Rate limits"
msgstr "Batas pesan"

#: includes/class-admin.php:922
msgid "Limits per visitor. A visitor over a limit is offered WhatsApp or email instead, and nothing is sent to Anthropic."
msgstr "Batas per pengunjung. Pengunjung yang melewati batas ditawari WhatsApp atau email, dan tidak ada yang dikirim ke Anthropic."

#: includes/class-admin.php:925
msgid "Messages per minute"
msgstr "Pesan per menit"

#: includes/class-admin.php:926
msgid "New chats per hour"
msgstr "Chat baru per jam"

#: includes/class-admin.php:927
msgid "Messages per day"
msgstr "Pesan per hari"

#: includes/class-admin.php:928
msgid "Messages per chat"
msgstr "Pesan per chat"

#: includes/class-admin.php:932
msgid "File-sharing services"
msgstr "Layanan berbagi file"

#: includes/class-admin.php:934
msgid "Refused links"
msgstr "Tautan yang ditolak"

#: includes/class-admin.php:934
msgid "One host per line. A message linking to one of these is refused, and the visitor is asked to send files by WhatsApp or email. Leave empty for the built-in list."
msgstr "Satu host per baris. Pesan yang menautkan ke salah satunya ditolak, dan pengunjung diminta mengirim file lewat WhatsApp atau email. Kosongkan untuk memakai daftar bawaan."

#: includes/class-admin.php:983
msgid "The SI never works out a price itself. Every estimate is calculated in code from this table, in whole rupiah, and shown to the visitor as an estimate that your team confirms. Keep it the same as your public price list."
msgstr "SI tidak pernah menghitung harga sendiri. Setiap estimasi dihitung oleh kode dari tabel ini, dalam rupiah bulat, dan ditampilkan kepada pengunjung sebagai estimasi yang dikonfirmasi tim Anda. Samakan isinya dengan daftar harga publik Anda."

#: includes/class-admin.php:988
#, php-format
msgid "Using the bundled table, copied from the Nusalexia price list on %s. It follows plugin updates until you change it."
msgstr "Memakai tabel bawaan, disalin dari daftar harga Nusalexia pada %s. Tabel ini ikut diperbarui bersama plugin sampai Anda mengubahnya."

#: includes/class-admin.php:991
