#: includes/si/class-admin-conversations.php:326
msgid "Use the export to answer a visitor who asks for a copy of their data, and delete when they ask you to remove it. Under Indonesia's data protection rules (UU 27/2022 and PP 33/2026), check that the request comes from the person in the chat, answer within 3 × 24 hours, and tell them when the deletion is done. The deletion itself is logged by reference only."
msgstr "Gunakan ekspor untuk menjawab pengunjung yang meminta salinan datanya, dan hapus jika mereka meminta datanya dihapus. Menurut aturan pelindungan data pribadi Indonesia (UU 27/2022 dan PP 33/2026), pastikan permintaan berasal dari orang dalam chat tersebut, tanggapi paling lambat 3 × 24 jam, dan beri tahu mereka setelah penghapusan selesai. Penghapusannya sendiri hanya dicatat dengan nomor referensi."

