#: includes/si/class-privacy.php:43
msgid "[contact email]"
msgstr "[email kontak]"

#: includes/si/class-privacy.php:47
msgid "Suggested text for the SI chat of ContextChat. It was checked against Indonesia's Personal Data Protection Law (UU 27/2022) and its implementing regulation (PP 33/2026), but it is not legal advice. Fill in the parts in square brackets and have it reviewed before you publish it."
msgstr "Contoh teks untuk chat SI ContextChat. Teks ini sudah dicocokkan dengan UU Pelindungan Data Pribadi (UU 27/2022) dan peraturan pelaksanaannya (PP 33/2026), tetapi bukan nasihat hukum. Lengkapi bagian dalam kurung siku dan mintakan tinjauan hukum sebelum diterbitkan."

#: includes/si/class-privacy.php:48
msgid "Chat with our SI assistant"
msgstr "Chat dengan asisten SI kami"

#: includes/si/class-privacy.php:51
#, php-format
msgid "The chat on this site is run by %1$s ([company address]). We decide how chat data is used and are responsible for it. Contact: %2$s."
msgstr "Chat di situs ini dijalankan oleh %1$s ([alamat perusahaan]). Kami menentukan penggunaan data chat dan bertanggung jawab atasnya sebagai Pengendali Data Pribadi. Kontak: %2$s."

#: includes/si/class-privacy.php:53
msgid "What we collect."
msgstr "Data yang kami kumpulkan."

#: includes/si/class-privacy.php:53
msgid "The messages you type; the details of your request that you give in them, such as document types, languages, number of pages, destination country and deadline; the estimates the chat gives you; the page address where you opened the chat (without anything after \"?\"), your language and whether you use a phone or a computer; and a chat reference number. We do not store your IP address: to stop misuse, messages are counted against a code that changes every day."
msgstr "Pesan yang Anda ketik; rincian kebutuhan yang Anda sebutkan di dalamnya, seperti jenis dokumen, bahasa, jumlah halaman, negara tujuan, dan tenggat; estimasi yang diberikan chat; alamat halaman tempat Anda membuka chat (tanpa bagian setelah \"?\"), bahasa Anda, dan apakah Anda memakai ponsel atau komputer; serta nomor referensi chat. Kami tidak menyimpan alamat IP Anda: untuk mencegah penyalahgunaan, pesan dihitung berdasarkan kode yang berganti setiap hari."

#: includes/si/class-privacy.php:54
msgid "Please do not send ID numbers, documents or links to file-sharing services in the chat. The chat refuses them, and such messages are neither stored nor sent to Anthropic. Send documents by WhatsApp or email instead."
msgstr "Mohon jangan mengirim nomor identitas, dokumen, atau tautan layanan berbagi file di chat. Chat menolaknya, dan pesan seperti itu tidak disimpan maupun dikirim ke Anthropic. Kirim dokumen lewat WhatsApp atau email."

#: includes/si/class-privacy.php:55
msgid "Why."
msgstr "Tujuan."

#: includes/si/class-privacy.php:55
msgid "To answer your questions about our services, to calculate estimates from our price list, and to prepare a summary for our team when you continue by WhatsApp or email."
msgstr "Untuk menjawab pertanyaan Anda tentang layanan kami, menghitung estimasi dari daftar harga, dan menyiapkan ringkasan untuk tim kami saat Anda melanjutkan lewat WhatsApp atau email."

#: includes/si/class-privacy.php:56
msgid "Legal basis."
msgstr "Dasar pemrosesan."

#: includes/si/class-privacy.php:57
msgid "[Choose after legal review: your request before entering into an agreement with us (UU 27/2022 Article 20(2)(b)), or our legitimate interest in answering enquiries (Article 20(2)(f)), with the assessment PP 33/2026 Articles 53 and 54 require.]"
msgstr "[Pilih setelah tinjauan hukum: pemenuhan permintaan Anda sebelum membuat perjanjian dengan kami (UU 27/2022 Pasal 20 ayat (2) huruf b), atau kepentingan sah kami untuk menjawab pertanyaan (Pasal 20 ayat (2) huruf f) disertai analisis yang diwajibkan PP 33/2026 Pasal 53 dan 54.]"

#: includes/si/class-privacy.php:58
msgid "Your explicit consent, given with the \"Agree and start\" button before the chat begins (UU 27/2022 Article 20(2)(a)). You can withdraw it at any time by writing to us; we then stop processing and delete the chat."
msgstr "Persetujuan eksplisit Anda, yang diberikan dengan tombol \"Setuju dan mulai\" sebelum chat dimulai (UU 27/2022 Pasal 20 ayat (2) huruf a). Anda dapat menariknya kapan saja dengan menulis kepada kami; kami lalu menghentikan pemrosesan dan menghapus chat."

#: includes/si/class-privacy.php:59
msgid "Processing by Anthropic, outside Indonesia."
msgstr "Pemrosesan oleh Anthropic, di luar Indonesia."

#: includes/si/class-privacy.php:59
msgid "To write the replies, your messages and the chat so far are sent to Anthropic, PBC, a language-model provider based in the United States, which processes them for us. According to Anthropic, it deletes API inputs and outputs within 30 days, unless longer retention is needed to enforce its usage policy or required by law. [Describe the safeguard for this transfer and its risks after legal review, as PP 33/2026 Articles 164 to 173 require, for example Anthropic's Data Processing Addendum with standard contractual clauses.]"
msgstr "Untuk menyusun jawaban, pesan Anda dan isi chat sejauh ini dikirim ke Anthropic, PBC, penyedia model bahasa yang berkedudukan di Amerika Serikat, yang memprosesnya atas nama kami. Menurut Anthropic, input dan output API dihapus dalam 30 hari, kecuali perlu disimpan lebih lama untuk menegakkan kebijakan penggunaannya atau diwajibkan hukum. [Jelaskan pelindungan untuk transfer ini beserta risikonya setelah tinjauan hukum, sebagaimana diwajibkan PP 33/2026 Pasal 164 sampai 173, misalnya Data Processing Addendum Anthropic dengan klausul kontrak standar.]"

#: includes/si/class-privacy.php:61
msgid "How long."
msgstr "Masa simpan."

#: includes/si/class-privacy.php:63
#, php-format
msgid "Each chat, with its estimates, is kept on this site for %d days from its start and then deleted automatically. We keep only a record that a deletion took place."
msgstr "Setiap chat beserta estimasinya disimpan di situs ini selama %d hari sejak dimulai, lalu dihapus otomatis. Kami hanya menyimpan catatan bahwa penghapusan telah dilakukan."

#: includes/si/class-privacy.php:66
msgid "Your rights."
msgstr "Hak Anda."

#: includes/si/class-privacy.php:68
#, php-format
msgid "You may ask for information about this processing, a copy of your chat, correction, deletion, or for processing to be paused or limited, and you may object to decisions made only by automated means. The chat gives estimates only; our team confirms every price. Write to %s and quote the chat reference shown at the top of the chat (it starts with CC-). We answer within 3 × 24 hours after checking that the request is yours."
msgstr "Anda dapat meminta informasi tentang pemrosesan ini, salinan chat Anda, perbaikan, penghapusan, atau penundaan dan pembatasan pemrosesan, serta mengajukan keberatan atas keputusan yang hanya didasarkan pada pemrosesan otomatis. Chat hanya memberi estimasi; setiap harga dikonfirmasi oleh tim kami. Tulis ke %s dan sebutkan referensi chat di bagian atas chat (diawali CC-). Kami menanggapi paling lambat 3 × 24 jam setelah memastikan permintaan itu berasal dari Anda."

#: includes/si/class-privacy.php:70
msgid "Security."
msgstr "Keamanan."

#: includes/si/class-privacy.php:70
msgid "Chats are stored in our website database and only our administrators can read them. If chat data is ever exposed, we will tell you and the data protection authority in writing within 3 × 24 hours."
msgstr "Chat disimpan di database situs kami dan hanya dapat dibaca oleh administrator kami. Jika terjadi kegagalan pelindungan data chat, kami memberi tahu Anda dan lembaga pelindungan data pribadi secara tertulis paling lambat 3 × 24 jam."

#: includes/si/class-privacy.php:71
msgid "[Children: the chat is meant for adults. Decide with your legal review how you identify visitors under 18 and obtain a parent's or guardian's consent, as PP 33/2026 Article 38 requires.]"
msgstr "[Anak: chat ini ditujukan untuk orang dewasa. Tentukan bersama tinjauan hukum cara mengenali pengunjung berusia di bawah 18 tahun dan memperoleh persetujuan orang tua atau wali, sebagaimana diwajibkan PP 33/2026 Pasal 38.]"

#: includes/si/class-si-secrets.php:71
msgid "That does not look like an Anthropic API key. Keys start with \"sk-ant-\" and contain no spaces."
msgstr "Itu tidak terlihat seperti API key Anthropic. Key diawali \"sk-ant-\" dan tidak mengandung spasi."

#: includes/si/class-si-secrets.php:75
msgid "This site has no unique AUTH_KEY in wp-config.php, so the key cannot be stored safely. Add the key to wp-config.php instead: define( 'CONTEXTCHAT_ANTHROPIC_KEY', 'sk-ant-…' );"
msgstr "Situs ini tidak punya AUTH_KEY yang unik di wp-config.php, jadi key tidak bisa disimpan dengan aman. Tambahkan key ke wp-config.php: define( 'CONTEXTCHAT_ANTHROPIC_KEY', 'sk-ant-…' );"
